# The user's own reinstall script is environment-specific and often contains
# internal server names. The .example version is what ships.
ClientReinstall.ps1

# Transcripts, reports and backups produced by a local run
*.log
*.lo_
*.cmtrace.log
Logs/
Backups/

# Only the reports this tool writes, not every .json in the tree. A bare
# *.json would silently swallow a config file added later, and the resulting
# "why is my setting being ignored" is a bad afternoon.
diagnosis.json
*.report.json
mecmdoctor-*.json

# Windows / editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
